        "description": "MENU: “Hey so, I know Mina told you not to hang out too long in that broken tube room, but…”\nMENU: “I can’t sense whatever she’s picking up on and there’s something of interest to us here.” \nMENU: “According to the map data, this room has a chance of dropping a screwdriver.”\nMENU: “If you haven’t already grabbed one from the junkyard then this would be a great place to scavenge one.”\nMENU: “Even if you don’t find one, give it a shot.”",
