        "name": "Platforming Game",
        "description": "MENU: “Those people from the labs really got comfortable in these caves, they left their garbage everywhere.”\nMENU: “Head down to the toadstool platforms, I wanna see if there’s anywhere they didn’t trash.”\nMENU: “Let the Kami poke around there, maybe we’ll find something better than cigarette butts and stale burgers.”",
