        "description": "MINA: “The growth of these giant toadstools… It’s a bit strange.”\nMINA: “It’s a very large cavern in breadth and depth. The mushrooms nearly fill it.”\nMINA: “They must be getting plenty of sustenance.”\nMINA: “Harvest here for a while. You’ll get a better sense of the decay.”",
