          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 47,
        "name": "Ringing Any Bells I",
        "description": "MINA: “Hey. You.”\nMINA “While Menu is doing her scans, can you examine that bell hanging above the crossroads for me?”\nMINA: “It doesn’t appear to match the age or style of the decor we’ve seen in prior rooms.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 48,
        "name": "Pipe Dream",
        "description": "MENU: “In your world, there’s this concept called the law of superposition.” \nMENU: “It says that the rocks at the bottom are older than the rocks at the top and that stuff was laid down in sequential layers.”\nMENU: “Even if those layers get tipped or flipped or something, there’s an original stacking order.”\nMENU: “The pipes running through the walls kinda break that rule though. They’re actually older than the rock itself.”\nMINA: “That might be a result of some of the magic left behind from the original inhabitants of this place. Hard to say.”\nMINA: “If you scavenge some of the pipes, we might be able to tell you more.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 49,
        "name": "You Smelt It…",
        "description": "MINA: “Those pipes don’t seem structurally necessary, so there shouldn’t be any harm in yanking them out and melting them down.”\nMINA: “Use the portable burner to do it. It can get hotter than you might think.”\nMINA: “It came with a crucible. Don’t worry if you never noticed before.”\nMINA: “You can also make ingots from those scrap metal cans you found on the surface.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 50,
        "name": "Community Service",
        "description": "MINA: “The litter is out of control, even inside of these caves.”\nMINA: “At least the literal piles of garbage haven’t made it here yet.”\nMINA: “You’re good at menial tasks. Do me a favor and pick up a few of the cigarette butts, at least.”\nMENU: “That’s not going to do anything, you know they'll just come back. Don’t you have anything more import-”\nMENU: “...”\nMENU: “Actually, could you give them to me afterwards? I have an idea.”\nMINA: “Please don’t share it with us.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 51,
        "name": "Ringing Any Bells II",
        "description": "MENU: “Something in the cave crossroads is still ringing a bell. Pardon the joke.”\nMENU: “You still have that essence of hearing your Kami scavenged earlier, right?”\nMENU: “Mina, do you think it would let me hear things the way a human can?”\nMINA: “An interesting theory dear, I don’t see the harm in testing it.”\nMINA: “The operator can always scavenge another essence.”\nMINA: “I think you should go for it.”\nMENU: “Let’s do it. Operator, get me an Essence of Hearing please, it’s time for some science.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 52,
        "name": "Ringing Any Bells III",
        "description": "MENU: “I’m ready. Time to ring that bell.”\nMENU: “It’s pretty big, so make sure you give it a good hard smack.”\nMENU: “If I’m going to hear it, I want to really hear it!”\nMINA: “Use the biggest rock you can get as a mallet. Make an Ashlar if you have to.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 53,
        "name": "Flash Back",
        "description": "MENU: “Mina, can you see the paper talismans around the Crossroads?”\nMENU: “They might be easy to miss with the naked eye.”\nMINA: “Of course. Obviously some sort of magical item or artifact.”\nMINA: “Bring one to me.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 54,
        "name": "Out of the Blue",
        "description": "MINA: “Are your Kami feeling hungry?”\nMINA: “You can always come back to my shop, you know.”\nMINA: “I suppose if you’re too lazy to make the trip, I can let you in on some useful information.”\nMINA: “These blue flowers that grow on the cave walls are edible.”\nMINA: “Your kami won’t be satisfied eating just one, they aren’t very nutritious, more of a light snack really.”\nMINA: “They are quite plentiful, though. And honestly delightful.\"\nMINA: “Scavenge some and you’ll see what I mean.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 55,
        "name": "Everything’s Rosy in the Garden",
        "description": "MINA: “What an adorable little mushroom garden.”\nMINA: “It seems to have been abandoned recently. A few decades, maybe a few centuries ago at the most.”\nMINA: “While the fungus of the underworld has its own uses, I’m more interested in something else.”\nMINA: “The stone flowers hiding among the mushroom patches.”\nMINA: “That’s another of those sensory essences. Make sure to have at least one in your pocket for later.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 56,
        "name": "Feel Like a Mushroom Myself",
        "description": "MENU: “Wow, the garden down the middle of this cave just keeps going.”\nMINA: “These mushrooms are rarely found in such dense numbers.”\nMINA: “If you look closely, you can see the second layer already growing in.”\nMINA: “It’s a fungus that grows like a weed when fed properly, but it can rarely get what it wants.”\nMENU: “My ‘magician enemies’ must have cultivated them hoping to block our way. I don’t think that’ll work very well.”\nMENU: “Set your Kami harvesting while I take a closer look.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 57,
        "name": "Top 10 Smoke Spots in Kamigotchi World",
        "description": "MENU: “That spot overlooking the pit… It seems like it would be a great place to stop and have a smoke.”\nMENU: “It’s strange, when I think about smoking I get the most peculiar cravings.”\nMENU: “It’s almost like I miss it, but how can I miss something I’ve never experienced?”\nMENU: “You don’t need to answer that, I’m just thinking out loud.”\nMENU: “I feel like, if I could just sit here with you and light one up right now, all my memory files would unlock and everything missing would come flooding back.”\nMENU: “I know that must sound very silly to you, it sounds silly to me.”\nMENU: “But still, can you get me some cigarette butts? Not even for the microplastics.”\nMENU: “Just…call it nostalgia for a life never lived.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 58,
        "name": "Flower of the Flock",
        "description": "MENU: “These blue flowers you find in the caves, they’re so striking.”\nMENU: “They look like the butterflies in the fields and woods outside.”\nMENU: “Maybe there’s a connection between them?” \nMENU: “You should deliver some to Mina, she can probably tell us more about them.”\nMINA: “I’ve already explained how they can be used in a delightful salad.”\nMINA: “But you raise an interesting question. I’ll be happy to take a look.”\n",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 59,
        "name": "Ordinary Intermediate Potion Crafting (Very Boring) I\n",
        "description": "MINA: “Hey, shh.” \nMINA: “Be quiet. We don’t want Menu to hear us.”\nMINA: “I’m sure that’s impossible considering where this conversation is taking place, but I’m trying.”\nMINA: “Menu is more magical than she likes to think, so I put up anti-scrying measures.”\nMINA: “They should work as long as she remains unaware of their presence.”\nMINA: “It’s time to teach you some intermediate hexerei with a recipe I’ve just invented.”\nMINA: “Start by scavenging some cigarette butts from the cave system. You know I find them disgusting, but it’s important.”\nMINA: “And don’t tell Menu anything, we don’t want to spoil the surprise.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 60,
        "name": "Ordinary Intermediate Potion Crafting (Very Boring) II\n",
        "description": "MINA: “The mushroom garden in the central hall of this cave is adorable.”\nMINA: “It seems to have been abandoned recently. A few decades, maybe a few centuries ago at the most.”\nMINA: “While the fungus of the underworld has its own uses, I’m more interested in something else.”\nMINA: “You can find rare stone flowers hiding among the mushroom patches.”\nMINA: “Those flowers are another of the sensory essences. Make sure to have at least one in your pocket for our potion.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 61,
        "name": "Ordinary Intermediate Potion Crafting (Very Boring) III",
        "description": "MENU: “What’s with these random tasks that Mina has you doing?”\nMENU: “She won’t tell me anything about it. And I'm having a hard time seeing what you're doing all of a sudden!”\nMENU: “Hey, where are you going?”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 62,
        "name": "Ordinary Intermediate Potion Crafting (Very Boring) IV",
        "description": "MINA: “Is she gone?”\nMINA: “Phew, that was a close one.”\nMINA: “Now, observe closely. Even though these butts have been smoked down to stubs, there is still a bit of tobacco left inside them.”\nMINA:  “Menu doesn’t have a physical form. Obviously, just collecting the loose tobacco won’t let her actually smoke.”\nMINA: “And even with the Essence trick we tried with that bell, it’s too short-lived and singular.”\nMINA: “But I’ve got it all worked out now.”\nMINA: “Peel the petals of the Essence of Taste and grind them up in your mortar.”\nMINA: “They’ll release oil and emulsify into a thin slurry.”\nMINA: “Now, fold in the tobacco.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 63,
        "name": "Ordinary Intermediate Potion Crafting (Very Boring) V",
        "description": "MINA: “Now that we’ve crafted this sacred incense, you’ll need to burn it in a spot where the $MUSU currents can carry the smoke properly.”\nMINA: “Head over to the Torii Gate down the road.”\nMINA: “The currents there should work nicely and be far enough away that I don’t get any secondhand smoke at my shop.”\nMINA: “Once you’re there, burn the paste in your portable burner.”\nMINA: “Don't tell Menu what you're doing, she'll figure it out soon enough. ;)”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 64,
        "name": "Full Flood",
        "description": "MINA: “Hey you, let’s give Menu some space, I have another task for you in the meantime.”\nMINA: “Head back into the caves and make your way to the mural on the wall outside of that antediluvian facility.”\nMINA: “Do you recognize the story it depicts?”\nMINA: “Nearly all cultures have their own version of the tale. It happened many, many times over the years.”\nMINA: “Harvest in that room and I shall study the mural. Perhaps this will tell the story in a way we haven’t all heard before.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 65,
        "name": "Old Fiends",
        "description": "MENU: “There’s a calm underground stream at the bottom of these caves.\"\nMENU: “The little carving on the rock there seems familiar to me somehow. I think I recognize the initials.” \nMENU: “Do some harvesting here while I try to remember.\"\nMENU: “That tobacco you gave me earlier is kind of helping me focus.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 66,
        "name": "First Contact",
        "description": "MINA: “In the middle of that facility, there’s a huge black door that doesn’t quite match the rest of it.”\nMINA: “It’s sealed up tight. I want you to check out the engraving on the face.”\nMINA: “Another old story that happened many times over the course of history.”\nMINA: “Gods granting knowledge to humanity, advancing their progress.”\nMINA: “Harvest some $MUSU while I read this and I’ll tell you about it.\"",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 67,
        "name": "Soaked to the Bone",
        "description": "MENU: “There’s another skeleton in the caves here, crumpled in the water underneath that observation deck.”\nMENU: “It could be someone I know. My memories are coming back more easily now.”\nMENU: “Let me do some scans and rack my circuits.”\nMENU: “Have your kami do some harvesting over there while you wait for me.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 68,
        "name": "On the Fringes",
        "description": "MINA: “Deep in the ancient facility, there’s a hatch that seems to lead nowhere at all, directly into a cave wall.”\nMINA: “I suspect this door might be meant to work like the entrance to my shop. I’m intrigued.”\nMINA: “Menu, you’re good with machines, would you be a dear and take a look at it?”\nMENU: “Sure! I’m on it! Operator, while you’re waiting for us, go ahead and harvest some $MUSU.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 69,
        "name": "The Doors of Perception",
        "description": "MINA: “There’s a specific flow of $MUSU around that hatch to nowhere.”\nMINA: “You should already know what I mean. It’s a fine place to harvest sensory essence.”\nMINA: “Evidence is mounting. This whole place has been renovated to encourage the capture of all six senses.\"\nMINA: “Scavenge around with your kami, we’ll see what else turns up.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 70,
        "name": "Reach Out And Touch Faith",
        "description": "MINA: “Something foul took place in the room with that broken tube. The $MUSU in there room feels tainted.”\nMINA: “Whatever was contained within those tubes left an unpleasant imprint onto the world around it.”\nMINA: “It seems like a bad idea to loiter for too long, but it’s worth investigating.”\nMINA: “Harvest some of the room’s $MUSU and I’ll see to figuring out what happened.\"",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 71,
        "name": "A Turn of the Screw",
        "description": "MENU: “Hey so, I know Mina told you not to hang out too long in that broken tube room, but…”\nMENU: “I can’t sense whatever she’s picking up on and there’s something of interest to us here.” \nMENU: “According to the map data, this room has a chance of dropping a screwdriver.”\nMENU: “If you haven’t already grabbed one from the junkyard then this would be a great place to scavenge one.”\nMENU: “Even if you don’t find one, give it a shot.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 72,
        "name": "Platforming Game",
        "description": "MENU: “Those people from the labs really got comfortable in these caves, they left their garbage everywhere.”\nMENU: “Head down to the toadstool platforms, I wanna see if there’s anywhere they didn’t trash.”\nMENU: “Let the Kami poke around there, maybe we’ll find something better than cigarette butts and stale burgers.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 73,
        "name": "What Lies Beneath",
        "description": "MINA: “The growth of these giant toadstools… It’s a bit strange.”\nMINA: “It’s a very large cavern in breadth and depth. The mushrooms nearly fill it.”\nMINA: “They must be getting plenty of sustenance.”\nMINA: “Harvest here for a while. You’ll get a better sense of the decay.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 74,
        "name": "Operator Goes To Camp",
        "description": "MINA: “Go on. Get moving.”\nMINA: “Menu tells me there’s a campsite ahead.” \nMINA: “You’re bound to find a clue left behind, the way these scoundrels litter.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 75,
        "name": "Digging Up Clues",
        "description": "MENU: “For litterbugs, they sure cleaned up anything that could trace them.”\nMENU: “Nothing to scavenge but the usual stuff.”\nMINA: “The blue flowers and mushrooms suggest magical practice.”\nMINA: “You might as well dig up some reagents while you’re here.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 76,
        "name": "Get Some Fresh Air",
        "description": "MENU: “Do me a favor and leave the caves for a minute.”\nMENU: “Head back to the Restricted Area and take a look at that office complex.”\nMENU: “This might be a pain, but I want you to make sure.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 77,
        "name": "Yep, That’s Wood",
        "description": "MENU: “That tent gave me an idea. Head back into the caves and go to the reinforced tunnel that branches off from the thriving mushrooms”\nMENU: “I want to check out the construction on those supports.”\nMENU: “It’s wood, yeah. But it’s like that stuff you make out of sticks and stems.”\nMENU: “You might as well grab a few more while you’re here.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 78,
        "name": "Plasmatics 101",
        "description": "MINA: “Have you seen that book leaning against the pillar?”\nMINA: “Menu seems to have no interest.”\nMINA: “She takes fascination in the strangest things.”\nMINA: “I’m always happy to find some new magical text, however.”\nMINA: “Have your Kami spend some time harvesting here while I negotiate with our mutual friend.” ",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 79,
        "name": "Fringe Theories",
        "description": "MENU: “I took a look at that “Plasmatics” book with Mina.”\nMENU: “Most of it is stuff I’m not really familiar with.\nMENU: “The parts I am familiar with, I can kind of tell it’s bullshit.”\nMENU: “But then there’s this other part that I can’t get a handle on.”\nMENU: “You mind going around and helping me compare it with the tech here?”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 80,
        "name": "The Great Divide",
        "description": "MENU: “Let’s go check out the canyon bridge, I think it’s more of that fake wood.”\nMENU: “Check if it’s sturdy by sending some Kami out on it.”\nMENU: “I’m just kidding!”\nMENU: “Get them harvesting, though.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 81,
        "name": "Edge of the Abyss",
        "description": "MINA: “There’s an abundance of the blue pansies to be found around that canyon.”\nMINA: “It usually means an abundance of magic.”\nMINA: “Scavenge around and snatch a few up, let’s have a closer look.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 82,
        "name": "Blue Light Special",
        "description": "MENU: “Let’s check out those giant crystals in the geometric caves next!”\nMENU: “There’s gotta be something cool in there.”\nMINA: “I don’t need to give you the lesson about $MUSU currents again do I?”\nMINA: “It should be obvious that just as I predicted, you’ll find another essence there.”\nMINA: “It seems you can’t touch that lantern though. No great worry.”\nMINA: “A bit strange, but no obstacle.” \nMINA: “As long as you and your Kami can scavenge, you’re gold.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 83,
        "name": "Vision of Life",
        "description": "MINA: “Make sure to get the essence in this room.”\nMINA: “Of all six, Sight is one of the most prized.”\nMINA: “The power of a true vision is worth much.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 84,
        "name": "Soot and Ash",
        "description": "MENU: “Have you seen the flower mural in the back corner of the caves yet? It’s beautiful.”\nMENU: “Except for the burnt pages of some book all over the floor.”\nMENU: “They must have used that for the carbon. Passionate about their art.”\nMENU: “Burnt up scraps are gonna be hard to decipher. I’ll work on it.”\nMENU: “Have your Kami do their thing. I’ll do mine.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 85,
        "name": "Sigil Magic",
        "description": "MINA: “I believe that flower is more than just a pretty drawing.”\nMINA: “Have you heard of sigil magic?”\nMINA: “It’s quite old, but had a modern revival some decades past.”\nMINA: “You may have read about it in a comic book.”\nMINA: “To seal your magic in a single image. That’s what this is.”\nMINA: “Let your Kami out to harvest and search more thoroughly.”\nMINA: “I wonder about those scraps.”",
