        "description": "MENU: “For litterbugs, they sure cleaned up anything that could trace them.”\nMENU: “Nothing to scavenge but the usual stuff.”\nMINA: “The blue flowers and mushrooms suggest magical practice.”\nMINA: “You might as well dig up some reagents while you’re here.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 76,
        "name": "Get Some Fresh Air",
        "description": "MENU: “Do me a favor and leave the caves for a minute.”\nMENU: “Head back to the Restricted Area and take a look at that office complex.”\nMENU: “This might be a pain, but I want you to make sure.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 77,
        "name": "Yep, That’s Wood",
        "description": "MENU: “That tent gave me an idea. Head back into the caves and go to the reinforced tunnel that branches off from the thriving mushrooms”\nMENU: “I want to check out the construction on those supports.”\nMENU: “It’s wood, yeah. But it’s like that stuff you make out of sticks and stems.”\nMENU: “You might as well grab a few more while you’re here.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 78,
        "name": "Plasmatics 101",
        "description": "MINA: “Have you seen that book leaning against the pillar?”\nMINA: “Menu seems to have no interest.”\nMINA: “She takes fascination in the strangest things.”\nMINA: “I’m always happy to find some new magical text, however.”\nMINA: “Have your Kami spend some time harvesting here while I negotiate with our mutual friend.” ",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 79,
        "name": "Fringe Theories",
        "description": "MENU: “I took a look at that “Plasmatics” book with Mina.”\nMENU: “Most of it is stuff I’m not really familiar with.\nMENU: “The parts I am familiar with, I can kind of tell it’s bullshit.”\nMENU: “But then there’s this other part that I can’t get a handle on.”\nMENU: “You mind going around and helping me compare it with the tech here?”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 80,
        "name": "The Great Divide",
        "description": "MENU: “Let’s go check out the canyon bridge, I think it’s more of that fake wood.”\nMENU: “Check if it’s sturdy by sending some Kami out on it.”\nMENU: “I’m just kidding!”\nMENU: “Get them harvesting, though.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 81,
        "name": "Edge of the Abyss",
        "description": "MINA: “There’s an abundance of the blue pansies to be found around that canyon.”\nMINA: “It usually means an abundance of magic.”\nMINA: “Scavenge around and snatch a few up, let’s have a closer look.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 82,
        "name": "Blue Light Special",
        "description": "MENU: “Let’s check out those giant crystals in the geometric caves next!”\nMENU: “There’s gotta be something cool in there.”\nMINA: “I don’t need to give you the lesson about $MUSU currents again do I?”\nMINA: “It should be obvious that just as I predicted, you’ll find another essence there.”\nMINA: “It seems you can’t touch that lantern though. No great worry.”\nMINA: “A bit strange, but no obstacle.” \nMINA: “As long as you and your Kami can scavenge, you’re gold.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 83,
        "name": "Vision of Life",
        "description": "MINA: “Make sure to get the essence in this room.”\nMINA: “Of all six, Sight is one of the most prized.”\nMINA: “The power of a true vision is worth much.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 84,
        "name": "Soot and Ash",
        "description": "MENU: “Have you seen the flower mural in the back corner of the caves yet? It’s beautiful.”\nMENU: “Except for the burnt pages of some book all over the floor.”\nMENU: “They must have used that for the carbon. Passionate about their art.”\nMENU: “Burnt up scraps are gonna be hard to decipher. I’ll work on it.”\nMENU: “Have your Kami do their thing. I’ll do mine.”",
        "repeatable": false,
        "account": {
          "accepted": false,
          "complete": false,
          "requirementsMet": false
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 85,
        "name": "Sigil Magic",
        "description": "MINA: “I believe that flower is more than just a pretty drawing.”\nMINA: “Have you heard of sigil magic?”\nMINA: “It’s quite old, but had a modern revival some decades past.”\nMINA: “You may have read about it in a comic book.”\nMINA: “To seal your magic in a single image. That’s what this is.”\nMINA: “Let your Kami out to harvest and search more thoroughly.”\nMINA: “I wonder about those scraps.”",
